.env
docker-data/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
tests/ws*/
tests/out*/

# Deliverables pulled out of an agent's container to read. They belong to the task that
# produced them, not to this repo — the canonical copies live in OneDrive.
option-trading-book*.txt
option-trading-book*.md

# Git Bash on Windows turns a stray `> nul` into a real zero-byte file.
nul
# The agents' memory: bare git repos bind-mounted into the containers (D5). Deliberately NOT
# in this repo — it is machine state with its own history, and nesting one git repo inside
# another is how you lose both. Back it up as a folder, or push it to its own remote.
memory-remotes/
